    <heroContent>
      <Value><![CDATA[<p>We are ready to provide you with advice or a quote.<strong><br />Send us an enquiry <a href="/{localLink:umb://document/695010147d8a408a8922b1d1b4f1d905}#reachout" title="Head Office" data-anchor="#reachout">here</a></strong> or call <strong>060 727 8002.</strong></p>
<p style="text-align: left;">Our accredited facilities are equipped to perform a wide range of chemical tests related to aggregates. These tests ensure the quality of designs for roadworks and concrete.</p>]]></Value>
